---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Dangerous Lawn Games — So Fun It’s Dangerous"
  description="A dangerous new concept for premium lawn game rentals in Raleigh and the Triangle. Delivered, staged, and removed."
  image="/assets/dangerous-hero.jpg"
  noindex={true}
>
  <main class="danger-site">
    <div class="hazard-rail" aria-hidden="true"><span>Warning: may cause excessive competition</span><span>Triangle delivery zone</span><span>Play responsibly</span><span>Warning: may cause excessive competition</span></div>

    <header class="danger-nav">
      <a class="danger-logo" href="/dangerous-lawn-games/" aria-label="Dangerous Lawn Games home">
        <span class="danger-logo-mark">!</span>
        <span>Dangerous<br />Lawn Games</span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Dangerous Lawn Games navigation">
        <a href="#evidence">The evidence</a>
        <a href="#danger-levels">Danger levels</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="hazard-button hazard-button-small" href="/#availability">Book responsibly <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </header>

    <section class="danger-hero">
      <div class="danger-hero-copy">
        <p class="hazard-label">Raleigh’s least necessary warning</p>
        <h1><span>So fun</span><em>it’s dangerous.</em></h1>
        <p class="danger-deck">Premium lawn games delivered, staged, and removed before anyone can demand a best-of-seven rematch.</p>
        <div class="danger-actions">
          <a class="hazard-button" href="/#availability">Enter the danger zone <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="underlined-link" href="#danger-levels">Assess your risk</a>
        </div>
        <p class="fine-warning"><strong>Actual warning:</strong> The games are not dangerous. The branding is a joke. The competition, however, may get personal.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="danger-hero-field" aria-label="Giant tumbling tower and cornhole games ready for a party">
        <img src="/assets/dangerous-hero.jpg" alt="Friends celebrating a cornhole throw beside giant tumbling blocks and four-in-a-row at an outdoor party" />
        <div class="danger-stamp"><small>Certified</small><strong>FUN</strong><span>Hazard</span></div>
        <div class="warning-card"><span>⚠</span><strong>Boring parties<br />end here.</strong></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="danger-ticker" aria-hidden="true">
      <div><span>Proceed with fun</span><i>◆</i><span>Trash talk likely</span><i>◆</i><span>No guest minimum</span><i>◆</i><span>Up to 8 hours</span><i>◆</i><span>Proceed with fun</span><i>◆</i><span>Trash talk likely</span><i>◆</i></div>
    </div>

    <section id="evidence" class="danger-evidence">
      <div class="evidence-intro">
        <p class="hazard-label">Incident report 001</p>
        <h2>Wholesome games.<br /><em>Unreasonable energy.</em></h2>
        <p>This is the contradiction: the activity is friendly, familiar, and easy to join. The brand acts like we’re transporting highly controlled party materials.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="side-effects">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>Accidental friendship</h3><p>Guests who arrived knowing no one are suddenly arguing over the cornhole scoreboard.</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h3>Extreme competitiveness</h3><p>The quiet cousin has challenged the CFO to giant four-in-a-row. Nobody saw it coming.</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h3>One more round</h3><p>The band is playing. Dessert is served. The giant tower still has unfinished business.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="danger-levels" class="danger-packages">
      <div class="danger-section-heading">
        <div><p class="hazard-label">Choose your exposure</p><h2>How dangerous<br />are we getting?</h2></div>
        <p>Every level includes event-day rental for up to 8 hours, Triangle delivery, clean equipment, intentional setup, and pickup after the evidence is collected.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="danger-level-grid">
        <article class="danger-level level-one">
          <figure class="danger-product-shot">
            <img src="/assets/dangerous-slightly-package.jpg" alt="Three-game package with cornhole, giant tumbling blocks, and ladder toss" loading="lazy" />
            <figcaption>3-game incident kit</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="level-meter"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <p class="hazard-label">Level 01</p>
          <h3>Slightly<br />Dangerous</h3>
          <p class="level-count">3 <small>games</small></p>
          <ul><li>Cornhole + giant blocks + ladder toss</li><li>Delivery, setup, and pickup</li><li>Best for intimate celebrations</li></ul>
          <footer><strong>$299</strong><a href="/#availability" aria-label="Request the Slightly Dangerous package">↗</a></footer>
        </article>

        <article class="danger-level level-two">
          <div class="most-dangerous">Most requested hazard</div>
          <figure class="danger-product-shot">
            <img src="/assets/dangerous-highly-package.jpg" alt="Five-game package with cornhole, giant tumbling blocks, oversized four-in-a-row, ladder toss, and ring toss" loading="lazy" />
            <figcaption>5-game incident kit</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="level-meter"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <p class="hazard-label">Level 02</p>
          <h3>Highly<br />Dangerous</h3>
          <p class="level-count">5 <small>games</small></p>
          <ul><li>Add four-in-a-row + ring toss</li><li>Delivery, setup, and pickup</li><li>Custom welcome sign included</li></ul>
          <footer><strong>$449</strong><a href="/#availability" aria-label="Request the Highly Dangerous package">↗</a></footer>
        </article>

        <article class="danger-level level-three">
          <figure class="danger-product-shot">
            <img src="/assets/dangerous-maximum-package.jpg" alt="Eight-game lawn takeover package with cornhole, giant blocks, four-in-a-row, ladder toss, ring toss, bocce, croquet, and giant dice" loading="lazy" />
            <figcaption>8-game lawn takeover</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="level-meter"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <p class="hazard-label">Level 03</p>
          <h3>Maximum<br />Danger</h3>
          <p class="level-count">8 <small>games</small></p>
          <ul><li>Add bocce + croquet + giant dice</li><li>Delivery, setup, and pickup</li><li>Built for large guest lists</li></ul>
          <footer><strong>$699</strong><a href="/#availability" aria-label="Request the Maximum Danger package">↗</a></footer>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="safety-copy">All games are inspected, cleaned, and set up with appropriate spacing. “Dangerous” describes the fun—not the equipment.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="danger-manifesto">
      <div class="manifesto-code" aria-hidden="true"><span>DLG</span><strong>NC</strong><small>35.7796° N<br />78.6382° W</small></div>
      <div class="manifesto-copy">
        <p class="hazard-label">Our operating protocol</p>
        <h2>Keep away from<br /><em>boring parties.</em></h2>
        <ol>
          <li><span>01</span><div><strong>You pick a date and danger level.</strong><p>Tell us where the incident is happening and what kind of crowd we’re dealing with.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>02</span><div><strong>We handle the heavy evidence.</strong><p>Games arrive clean, coordinated, and arranged so they look intentional in the space.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>03</span><div><strong>You accept the consequences.</strong><p>Guests play. Photos happen. We return for pickup when the danger has passed.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="danger-cta">
      <p class="hazard-label">Final warning</p>
      <h2>Your party may<br />never be boring again.</h2>
      <a class="hazard-button hazard-button-invert" href="/#availability">Proceed with fun <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <p>Serving Raleigh, Durham, Chapel Hill, and the Triangle.</p>
    </section>

    <footer class="danger-footer">
      <a class="danger-logo" href="/dangerous-lawn-games/"><span class="danger-logo-mark">!</span><span>Dangerous<br />Lawn Games</span></a>
      <p>Play at your own risk… of having too much fun.</p>
      <a href="/">View the current Popstar site</a>
    </footer>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  :root{--danger-ink:#11110f;--danger-bone:#f2eddf;--danger-acid:#dfff00;--danger-orange:#ff4e1f;--danger-white:#fffdf5;--danger-line:2px solid var(--danger-ink);--danger-display:"Bowlby One SC",Impact,sans-serif;--danger-mono:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace}.danger-site{min-height:100vh;overflow:hidden;background:var(--danger-bone);color:var(--danger-ink);font-family:var(--danger-mono)}.danger-site *{box-sizing:border-box}.danger-site h1,.danger-site h2,.danger-site h3,.danger-logo{font-family:var(--danger-display);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.045em}.hazard-rail{height:32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-around;gap:32px;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,var(--danger-acid) 0 16px,var(--danger-ink) 16px 32px);border-bottom:var(--danger-line)}.hazard-rail span{padding:3px 10px;background:var(--danger-acid);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.danger-nav{min-height:92px;padding:16px 4vw;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center;gap:36px;background:var(--danger-bone);border-bottom:var(--danger-line)}.danger-logo{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:max-content;font-size:16px;line-height:.82;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase}.danger-logo-mark{width:48px;height:48px;display:grid;place-items:center;clip-path:polygon(50% 0,100% 100%,0 100%);padding-top:12px;background:var(--danger-acid);font-family:var(--danger-display);font-size:25px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 0 var(--danger-ink))}.danger-nav nav{display:flex;gap:30px}.danger-nav nav a{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase}.danger-nav nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-underline-offset:6px}.danger-nav>.hazard-button{justify-self:end}.hazard-button{min-height:58px;padding:13px 20px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;border:var(--danger-line);background:var(--danger-acid);color:var(--danger-ink);font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--danger-ink);transition:transform 150ms cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1),box-shadow 150ms cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)}.hazard-button:hover{transform:translate(-3px,-3px);box-shadow:9px 9px 0 var(--danger-orange)}.hazard-button:active{transform:scale(.97)}.hazard-button:focus-visible,.danger-site a:focus-visible{outline:4px solid var(--danger-orange);outline-offset:4px}.hazard-button-small{min-height:46px;padding:9px 15px;font-size:10px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--danger-ink)}.danger-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;min-height:740px;border-bottom:var(--danger-line)}.danger-hero-copy{padding:clamp(70px,8vw,130px) 5vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;background:var(--danger-ink);color:var(--danger-white)}.hazard-label{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase}.hazard-label::before{content:"⚠";margin-right:9px;color:var(--danger-orange)}.danger-hero h1{max-width:900px;margin:0;font-size:clamp(72px,9vw,148px);line-height:.76;text-transform:uppercase}.danger-hero h1 span,.danger-hero h1 em{display:block}.danger-hero h1 em{color:var(--danger-acid);font-style:normal;transform:skewY(-2deg);transform-origin:left}.danger-deck{max-width:680px;margin:36px 0 28px;font:500 clamp(16px,1.6vw,22px)/1.45 var(--danger-mono)}.danger-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px}.underlined-link{color:var(--danger-white);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;text-underline-offset:7px}.fine-warning{max-width:700px;margin:42px 0 0;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);font-size:10px;color:#bcb8ad}.fine-warning strong{color:var(--danger-orange)}.danger-hero-field{position:relative;min-height:620px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--danger-orange)}.danger-hero-field>img{width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;inset:0;object-fit:cover;filter:saturate(.75) contrast(1.08)}.danger-hero-field::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(17,17,15,.05),rgba(17,17,15,.6))}.danger-stamp{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:7%;top:7%;width:180px;aspect-ratio:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:4px solid var(--danger-ink);border-radius:50%;background:var(--danger-acid);transform:rotate(10deg);text-transform:uppercase}.danger-stamp::before,.danger-stamp::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:8px;border:1px solid var(--danger-ink);border-radius:50%}.danger-stamp::after{inset:14px}.danger-stamp small,.danger-stamp span{font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em}.danger-stamp strong{font:400 47px/.9 var(--danger-display)}.warning-card{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:6%;bottom:7%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;padding:15px 18px;border:var(--danger-line);background:var(--danger-white);box-shadow:8px 8px 0 var(--danger-orange);transform:rotate(-2deg);text-transform:uppercase}.warning-card span{font-size:35px;color:var(--danger-orange)}.warning-card strong{font:400 21px/.9 var(--danger-display)}.crosshair{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:50%;top:47%;width:240px;aspect-ratio:1;border:2px solid var(--danger-acid);border-radius:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}.crosshair::before,.crosshair::after{content:"";position:absolute;background:var(--danger-acid)}.crosshair::before{width:2px;height:140%;left:50%;top:-20%}.crosshair::after{height:2px;width:140%;top:50%;left:-20%}.danger-ticker{overflow:hidden;padding:16px 0;background:var(--danger-acid);border-bottom:var(--danger-line)}.danger-ticker div{display:flex;width:max-content;align-items:center;gap:28px;animation:danger-scroll 24s linear infinite}.danger-ticker span{font-family:var(--danger-display);font-size:25px;text-transform:uppercase}.danger-ticker i{color:var(--danger-orange);font-style:normal}.danger-evidence{padding:clamp(80px,10vw,150px) 5vw;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9f